# Workers

Long work lives here, not in Edge Functions.

- `ai-document`: OCR optional → LLM → insert/update `ai_analyses`. Never auto-approve.
- `notify`: Expo Push + Resend; optional SMS later. Idempotent on `(user_id, kind, entity_id)`.
- Service role allowed only in this package and Edge Functions.
- Time out and retry LLM calls. Persist failures on the analysis row; do not crash the worker loop.
